<title>JAPAN: Foreigners net buyers of Japanese stocks in week.</title>
<headline>Foreigners net buyers of Japanese stocks in week.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners were net buyers of Japanese stocks on the Tokyo, Osaka and Nagoya stock exchanges in the week of June 2 to June 6, exchange data showed.</p>
<p>Foreigners were net buyers for the seventh consecutive week.</p>
<p>The figures, which are rounded, are as follows:</p>
<p>    Total foreign buying	   663.33 billion yen</p>
<p>    Total foreign selling	  512.45 billion yen</p>
<p>    Net buying			 150.88 billion yen</p>
<p>    Previous week net buying     207.30 billion yen</p>
